# Profile sharing (ADR 0024 §Profile sharing; ADR 0026 shapes).

enum ProfileShareStatus {
    "Offered and awaiting the target Household's decision."
    PENDING
    "The Profile is available in the Household."
    ACTIVE
    "Declined by the target Household."
    REJECTED
    "Withdrawn by the offerer, or replaced by a newer offer."
    CANCELED
    "Timed out before a decision."
    EXPIRED
    "Withdrawn by the system because the offer could no longer stand, as when its offerer lost authority or its Profile was transferred; invalidationReason says why."
    INVALIDATED
    "Ended after being active."
    ENDED
}

type ProfileShare {
    id: ID!
    profileId: ID!
    householdId: ID!
    status: ProfileShareStatus!
    requiredByAccountMembership: Boolean!
    expiresAt: String
    endedAt: String
    """
    Why the system withdrew this offer; set only when status is INVALIDATED. Shown to the same
    readers as household: the Profile's managers and ServerAdmins. Null for everyone else,
    including the target Household's HouseholdAdmins.
    """
    invalidationReason: String
    """
    The Profile on offer or shared. Shown to the Profile's managers and to ServerAdmins at every
    status. Shown to the target Household's HouseholdAdmins only while the offer is PENDING and not
    past its expiresAt, or the share is ACTIVE: once it is over, they get null. Null for everyone
    else.
    """
    profile: ProfileSummary
    """
    Whether the Profile is a visitor in the Household: it belongs to another Household. False for
    the Household's own Profiles. It follows where the Profile belongs now, so it can change when
    the Profile moves. Shown to the same readers as profile, and null for everyone else.
    """
    visitor: Boolean
    """
    The display name of the Account that offered the Profile. Shown to ServerAdmins, and to the
    target Household's HouseholdAdmins while the offer is PENDING and not past its expiresAt, or
    the share is ACTIVE. Null for everyone else, for a share that is over unless the reader is a
    ServerAdmin, for a share the system made, and once that Account is deleted.
    """
    offeredByDisplayName: String
    """
    The Household the Profile is offered or shared to, at every status. Shown to the Profile's
    managers and to ServerAdmins. Null for everyone else, including that Household's
    HouseholdAdmins. The Account of a self-managed Personal Profile is one of its managers; the
    Account of a supervised Personal Profile is not.
    """
    household: HouseholdSummary
}

"A Profile as a share shows it."
type ProfileSummary {
    id: ID!
    name: String!
    picture: String
    kind: ProfileKind!
    "Whether this is someone's Personal Profile, so accepting it lets that person use the Household."
    personalProfile: Boolean!
    "Whether the Profile is restricted, so the Household's HouseholdAdmins supervise it there."
    restricted: Boolean!
}

extend type Subscription {
    """
    A Profile share changed. A change arrives when a share is created or offered, accepted,
    declined, canceled, invalidated or ended, when an offer expires, when a share starts or stops
    being required by Account membership, when a share is deleted with its Profile or its
    Household, and, for the Profile's shares into the Households it leaves and joins, when the
    Profile moves to another Household, since whether it is a visitor there changes. An offer
    whose time runs out arrives as EXPIRED about a minute after its expiresAt;
    the share queries show it as EXPIRED from expiresAt on. A change that rolls back never arrives.

    Any signed-in session may subscribe, with or without a selected Profile. A device-bound session
    gets FORBIDDEN, and so does a disabled Account. A change reaches a subscriber only when the
    subscriber may read the share through householdShares or profileShares: the target
    Household's HouseholdAdmins, the Profile's managers, and ServerAdmins. The Account of a
    supervised Personal Profile is not one of its managers and receives none of its changes.
    The server decides this for each change as it delivers it, so a subscriber who loses that
    authority stops receiving the share's changes, and a share never reaches someone the queries
    would not show it to. The share's fields are hidden from the same readers as in the queries.

    The target Household's HouseholdAdmins follow a share while the offer is PENDING or the share
    is ACTIVE. They also get the change that ends it: the offer declined, canceled, expired or
    invalidated, or the share ended. That last change carries the share as that change left it,
    taken when the change was made: its id, profileId, householdId and status, with
    requiredByAccountMembership false and every other field null, so the client can take the share
    out of its lists. It carries that status even when the share is deleted, with its Profile,
    before the change is delivered. No change of that share reaches them after it, not even its
    removal. ServerAdmins and the Profile's managers get every change.
    A share deleted with its Profile reaches only those who may read its Household's shares, and
    a share deleted with its Household reaches only those who may read its Profile's shares.
    An operation whose Account may no longer follow share changes ends with FORBIDDEN.

    To build current state, subscribe first, then query householdShares or profileShares, and
    apply each change by shareId. The lists put the newest share first, so a share created after
    the client subscribed goes first; a change to a share on a page the client has not loaded can
    wait for that page. Keep a share in a profileShares list while its status is one of the list's
    statuses. Keep it in a householdShares list on the same terms when the reader is a ServerAdmin
    (me.serverAdmin); for anyone else, that list holds only offers that are PENDING and before
    their expiresAt, and ACTIVE shares, whatever its statuses, so keep a share there only while it
    is one of those. A HouseholdAdmin who also manages the Profile still gets the share's later
    changes through the Profile's side, and still drops it from their householdShares list once it
    is over. In a list kept to visitorsOnly, keep a share only while visitor is true. Remove a
    share when share is null without errors. A null share with errors is not a
    removal: keep the share and run the queries again. Except for that last change to the target
    Household's HouseholdAdmins, the server reads the share when it delivers the change, and it
    delivers one operation's changes in order, so the last change for a share carries its latest
    state. A share that stops being readable to the subscriber does not arrive
    as removed; the queries stop listing it. The operation does not complete while the server runs.
    """
    profileShareChanged: ProfileShareChange
}

"One committed change to a Profile share."
type ProfileShareChange {
    shareId: ID!
    """
    The share as the server reads it on delivery, or null once the share no longer exists, as when
    it was deleted with its Profile or its Household. The change that ends a share reaches a
    HouseholdAdmin who reads the share only from its Household as that change left it, never as
    null.
    """
    share: ProfileShare
}

type ProfileShareConnection {
    edges: [ProfileShareEdge!]!
    pageInfo: PageInfo!
}

type ProfileShareEdge {
    node: ProfileShare!
    cursor: String!
}

"The effects of offering this Profile to the Household."
type ProfileSharePreview {
    wouldLock: Boolean!
    nameConflict: Boolean!
}

input OfferProfileShareInput {
    profileId: ID!
    householdId: ID!
}

type OfferProfileSharePayload {
    share: ProfileShare
    userErrors: [OfferProfileShareError!]!
}

union OfferProfileShareError =
    ProfileNotFoundError
  | HouseholdNotFoundError
  | ProfileAlreadySharedError

input AcceptProfileShareInput {
    shareId: ID!
}

type AcceptProfileSharePayload {
    share: ProfileShare
    userErrors: [AcceptProfileShareError!]!
}

union AcceptProfileShareError =
    ShareNotFoundError
  | ShareNotPendingError
  | OfferInvalidatedError
  | RestrictedProfileRequiresHouseholdAdminError
  | ShareNameConflictError

input RejectProfileShareInput {
    shareId: ID!
}

type RejectProfileSharePayload {
    share: ProfileShare
    userErrors: [RejectProfileShareError!]!
}

union RejectProfileShareError = ShareNotFoundError | ShareNotPendingError

input CancelProfileShareInput {
    shareId: ID!
}

type CancelProfileSharePayload {
    share: ProfileShare
    userErrors: [CancelProfileShareError!]!
}

union CancelProfileShareError = ShareNotFoundError | ShareNotPendingError

input EndProfileShareInput {
    shareId: ID!
}

type EndProfileSharePayload {
    share: ProfileShare
    userErrors: [EndProfileShareError!]!
}

union EndProfileShareError =
    ShareNotFoundError
  | ShareNotActiveError
  | MembershipShareCannotEndError

input AdministrativelyEndProfileShareInput {
    shareId: ID!
    reason: String!
}

type AdministrativelyEndProfileSharePayload {
    share: ProfileShare
    userErrors: [AdministrativelyEndProfileShareError!]!
}

union AdministrativelyEndProfileShareError =
    ShareNotFoundError
  | ShareNotActiveError
  | MembershipShareCannotEndError
  | ReasonRequiredError
  | ReauthenticationRequiredError
